   212	    // i_mem_addr drive:
   213	    //   at_cross_boundary: fetch next word (fallback, same as lab08d)
   214	    //   consecutive_cross: keep pre-fetching for runs of high-half 32-bit instrs
   215	    //   upcoming_cross:    pre-fetch next word one cycle early (if_pc[1]=0 → +4 = next word)
   216	    //   else:              look-ahead via next_pc_w (normal)
