flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/J12_run.log:286:docs/reports/bug_xbound_0001/j10_rvc_lui_evidence.md:6:The false mismatch was in `flow/v2_pipeline/lib/spike_commit.py`. The old Spike parser subtracted `pc_base` from any writeback inside `[pc_base, pc_base + 0x10000)`. Raw Spike log for `0x6db5 c.lui s11,0xd` writes `x27=0x0000d000`, matching the DUT. The parser changed that to `0x0000c000`.
