flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:6:We have successfully achieved **Stage 5.0 RTL Lint Signoff** using Spyglass with zero errors/fatals. The project has also reached a major milestone in **functional verification** with a baseline functional coverage measured at 55.56% and 172 regression gates passing. Licensed EDA tools (VCS/URG/Spyglass) are now fully operational following the resolution of sandbox network isolation issues.
