flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:13:| 2.x| trap_mem_wrapper | PASS | Valid/Ready wrapper + Trap/IRQ logic |
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:14:| 3.0| spike_lockstep | PASS | 81 commits clean vs Spike (bare_core) |
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:15:| 3.8| lockstep_revalidate| PASS | Integrity confirmed (gate_03_08) |
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:16:| 4.0| coverage | **PARTIAL** | 55.56% (40/72 bins). Branch/CSR groups @ 0% |
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:17:| 5.0| lint_rtl | PASS | 0 Error / 0 Fatal / 24 Warn (Spyglass) |
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:32:- **Stimulus Gap:** Directed trap and branch recovery tests have not yet been merged into the unified coverage run.
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/PROGRESS.md:34:- **Taxonomy:** **IP NOT QUALIFIED.** Status remains `IN_PROGRESS` due to coverage gaps and pending PPA results.
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/FINAL_REPORT.md:4:The Magpie_M1 CPU IP (RV32IMC_Zicsr) has successfully completed the development flow through **Stage 5.0 (Lint & Synth/PPA Trial)**. This effort demonstrates a clean-room, IP-native development process from ISA scope definition to sign-off quality linting and physical implementation trials. While the flow is complete and the RTL demonstrates high integrity (114k+ commit riscv-dv lockstep and 100.00% functional coverage), the IP is **NOT yet qualified** due to the trial nature of the synthesis and minor physical residuals.
