flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/FINAL_REPORT.md:17:Functional coverage reached **100.00% (72/72 bins)**. The final bin `cg_hazard_flush:mem_stall` was hit via a wrapper-level wait-state coverage harness (`tb_wrapper_func_cov.sv` on `cpu_m1_top`). All 6 covergroups are at 100%.
